<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Animo Eats</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/view_profile.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gelasio:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&family=Hanuman:wght@100;300;400;700;900&family=Kalam:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
          <div class="logo">
            <a href="/" class="home_button">
              <span class="green">A</span>nimo <span class="green">E</span>ats
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="searchbar">
            <form>
              <input type="text" placeholder="Search Here..." />
              <button class="search_button">&#128269;</button>
            </form>
          </div>

          <div class="profilebuttons">
            <a href="/login_as" class="login_button"> Log In </a>
            <a href="/signup" class="signup_button"> Sign Up </a>
            <a href="/view_profile" class="view_profile_button">
              View Profile
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
          <div class="profile">
              <div >
                <img class="profilepicture" src="/uploads/{{user.avatar}}" alt="User Avatar">
              </div>


            <div class="info">
              <div class="username"><h1>{{user.username}}</h1></div>
              <div class="description">
                  <p>{{user.short_description}}</p>
                
              </div>
              <div class="options">
                <div class="editbutton">
                  <a href="/edit_profile" class="buttondesign">
                    Edit Profile
                  </a>
                </div>

                <div class="editbutton">
                  <a href="/logout" class="buttondesign">Logout</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="review">
            <div class="reviewtitle"><h1>Recent Activity</h1></div>
            <div class="reviewpost">
              <div class="establishmentname">
                Establishment:
                <span
                  ><a href="view_24chicken.html" class="establishmentname"
                    >24 Chicken</a
                  ></span
                >
              </div>
              <div class="title">Title: Our Favorite</div>
              <div class="ratingdiv">
                Rating: <span class="rating">★★★★★</span>
                <span><a href="/edit_review" class="editreview"></a></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="body">
              <p>
                I finally got to try 24 Chicken, and I was not disappointed! The
                chicken was perfectly crispy, flavorful, and well-seasoned, even
                without sauce. I ordered the Jack Daniel’s and Spicy Yangnyeom
                flavors, and both were amazing! The Jack Daniel’s had a unique,
                slightly smoky-sweet taste, while the Spicy Yangnyeom had just
                the right level of heat. What I love most is that their chicken
                is boneless, making it easy to eat, and the portions are
                generous for the price. I also tried their Kimchi Rice, which
                complemented the chicken really well. Delivery was quick, and
                the food arrived hot and fresh. Overall, 24 Chicken is a
                must-try for anyone who loves Korean fried chicken! Will
                definitely order again. 🍗🔥💯 #24ChickenPH #CrispyAndTasty
                #KoreanFriedChicken
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <div class="contact_information">
          <p><span class="green">&phone; </span>Contact Us</p>
          <p><b>Phone: </b>091231231123</p>
          <p><b>Email: </b>animoeats@gmail.com</p>
        </div>
        <div class="address">
          <p><span class="green">&#127988;</span> Address</p>
          <p>2401 Taft Ave, Malate, Manila, 1004 Metro Manila</p>
        </div>
